*.pth
*ckpt
*__pycache__/

# Per-checkpoint sidecars written next to the .ckpt during training. They must
# always match the checkpoint sitting beside them, so a committed copy is a
# footgun -- a stale pair would silently build an image whose architecture or
# normalization disagrees with its weights. Regenerate for testing with
# scripts/make_untrained_ckpt.py; use the real ones from training to deploy.
checkpoints/training_configs.json
checkpoints/normalizer_config.json
